      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just being tired though. it feels permanent. like no matter what i change, it's never gonna click. i'm just fundamentally broken or something. i look at people just living their lives so easily and i realize i'll never actually be part of that. it's like i'm living in a different reality than everyone else.",
