      "content": "i've tried all that. therapy, trying to \"fix\" myself, trying to meet people... it's all just more of the same performance. it feels like there's no point in fighting a battle that was lost before i was even born. sometimes i just wonder if the effort is even worth it anymore when the end result is always just more loneliness.",
